sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If four numbers are proportional, then they are also proportional alternately.
----
proof:

Let the four numbers {A}, {B}, {C}, and {D} be proportional, so that {A} is to {B} as {C} is to {D}.

